        "id": "7cfd6d7d-aba4-4bbd-97ba-581f46837167",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"我这把好业你开场你都不能发顶配手机开场\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "6f56beb7-8423-4f46-ac44-449e760b8099",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"你不得了我 你现在啊\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "ec68bb63-8c4f-4b24-8dcb-5acd268f0402",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"发了就发了 修轮轮就得用最好的呀\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "0b1ce39b-831f-467d-8cc3-a111b782ee03",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"我总感觉真的每次你开场\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "47a7dacb-1f68-4297-b3a9-2626e9d6d606",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"为什么总是比我开场的人要多呀\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "8accde35-4e16-406d-ae20-8753b549a590",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"我开完场我喝完水直播间直有四十多\"}",
